 "derived_from": [],
 "is_vocab": false,
 "stimulus_html": "Consider the time series given in the table as shown. <br>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><b>Month</b></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><b>Value</b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">1</td>\n<td align=\"right\">880.7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">2</td>\n<td align=\"right\">727.2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">3</td>\n<td align=\"right\">798.5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">4</td>\n<td align=\"right\">504.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">5</td>\n<td align=\"right\">888.4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">6</td>\n<td align=\"right\">725.8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">7</td>\n<td align=\"right\">793.4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">8</td>\n<td align=\"right\">499.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">9</td>\n<td align=\"right\">891.7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">10</td>\n<td align=\"right\">722.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">11</td>\n<td align=\"right\">789.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">12</td>\n<td align=\"right\">501.6</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody><caption>Time Series</caption>\n</table>\n",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 489918,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Identify the period of the seasonal component.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "There are peaks in the data at times 1, 5, and 9 as well as minimum points at times 4, 8, and 12, suggesting a period of 4 months."
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "See Solution Manual"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 489919,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Using a centered simple moving average (SMA) of window size equal to the period you found in part a, identify a trend-cycle component, <span data-math=\"t_n\"></span>, in the data.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "(728.6, 729.4, 728.6, 727.3, 727.1, 727.0, 726.0, 725.8)<br>\nThere will be 8 terms in the centered SMA, as shown. These values form the trend-cycle component. "
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><b>Month</b></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><b>Value</b></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><b>Centered SMA</b> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">1</td>\n<td align=\"right\">880.7</td>\n<td align=\"right\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">2</td>\n<td align=\"right\">727.2</td>\n<td align=\"right\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">3</td>\n<td align=\"right\">798.5</td>\n<td align=\"right\">728.6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">4</td>\n<td align=\"right\">504.1</td>\n<td align=\"right\">729.4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">5</td>\n<td align=\"right\">888.4</td>\n<td align=\"right\">728.6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">6</td>\n<td align=\"right\">725.8</td>\n<td align=\"right\">727.3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">7</td>\n<td align=\"right\">793.4</td>\n<td align=\"right\">727.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">8</td>\n<td align=\"right\">499.0</td>\n<td align=\"right\">727.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">9</td>\n<td align=\"right\">891.7</td>\n<td align=\"right\">726.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">10</td>\n<td align=\"right\">722.0</td>\n<td align=\"right\">725.8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">11</td>\n<td align=\"right\">789.1</td>\n<td align=\"right\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">12</td>\n<td align=\"right\">501.6</td>\n<td align=\"right\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\nSince the window size is even, we use the formula<br>\n<span data-math=\"y_k=\\frac{x_{k-2}}8+\\frac14(x_{k-1}+x_k+x_{k+1})+\\frac{x_{k+2}}8\"></span><br>\nThe smallest index for which we can compute the centered SMA is <span data-math=\"k=3\"></span> (otherwise the first term involving <span data-math=\"x_{k-2}\"></span> would be undefined).<br>\n<span data-math=\"y_3=\\frac{x_1}8+\\frac14{(x_2+x_3+x_4})+\\frac{x_5}8=\\frac{880.7}8+\\frac14{(727.2+798.5+504.1)}+\\frac{888.4}8=728.6\"></span><br>\n<span data-math=\"y_4=\\frac{x_2}8+\\frac14{(x_3+x_4+x_5)}+\\frac{x_6}8=\\frac{727.2}8+\\frac14{(798.5+504.1+888.4)}+\\frac{725.8}8=729.4\"></span><br>\n(similar…)\n<span data-math=\"y_{10}=\\frac{x_8}8+\\frac14{(x_9+x_{10}+x_{11})}+\\frac{x_{12}}8=\\frac{499.0}8+\\frac14{(891.7+722.0+789.1)}+\\frac{501.6}8=725.8\"></span>\n"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 489920,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Detrend the data by subtracting the SMA you found in part b.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "(69.9, −225.3, 159.8, −1.5, 66.3, −228.0, 165.7, −3.8)"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "Note, the sequence starts at index 3 and ends at 10 because centered SMA is undefined outside of this range.<br>\n<span data-math=\"x_3-y_3=798.5-728.6=69.9\"></span><br>\n<span data-math=\"x_4-y_4=888.4-729.4=-225.3\"></span><br>\n(similar…)<br>\n<span data-math=\"x_{10}-y_{10}=722.0-725.8=-3.8\"></span>\n"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 489921,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Identify the seasonal component, <span data-math=\"{\\widehat s}_n\"></span>, using the method of averaging.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "(68.1, −226.65, 162.75, −2.65), repeating in blocks of 4"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "Since the detrended time series has 8 terms with periodicity 4, each average will involve two terms. Again, the sequence starts at index 3.<br>\n<span data-math=\"\\begin{array}{rcl}{\\widehat s}_3&amp;=&amp;\\frac12{(69.9+66.3)}=68.1\\\\{\\widehat s}_4&amp;=&amp;\\frac12{(-225.3+{(-228.0)})}=-226.65\\\\{\\widehat s}_5&amp;=&amp;\\frac12{(159.8+165.7)}=162.75\\\\{\\widehat s}_6&amp;=&amp;\\frac12{(-1.5+(-3.8))}=-2.65\\end{array}\"></span>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 489922,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Find the seasonally adjusted time series.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "(812.6, 953.85, 635.75, 506.75, 820.3, 952.45, 630.65, 501.65, 823.6, 948.65, 626.35, 504.25)"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "Take the difference between the original time series and the seasonal component, <span data-math=\"x_n-{\\widehat s}_n\"></span>. The starting index is again 3.<br>\n<span data-math=\"\\begin{array}{rcl}x_3-{\\widehat s}_3&amp;=&amp;880.7-68.1=812.6\\\\x_4-{\\widehat s}_4&amp;=&amp;727.2-{(-226.65)}=953.85\\end{array}\"></span><br>\n(similar…)<br>\n<span data-math=\"{\\widehat s}_{10}=501.6-(-2.65)=504.25\"></span>\n"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
